# Two roads (WP-N1: roads/roads.js, design/data/roads.toml, the Life 2 karma ledger in karma/karma.js, the O-N1 Life 1 bans
# in life/mortal_banned.js). `ttl roads expect`, `ttl karma expect`, `ttl rep expect` and `ttl stash ... spell` print
# "ttl: ..." when wrong, which `server.sh test-all` counts as a failure.
# A takes routes on a platform far from every NPC; B is the witness (R14: a Life 2 player within 32 blocks); L is a Life 1
# soul in the Mortal Realm. Discord is muted in tests: expect "[ttl] discord: dropped (...): A soul in ... has raised the
# dead with soul ash." once, "[ttl] roads: TtlBotRoadsA took necro.raise dark: karma {"chaos":3} ..." and, at the Life 1
# death, "[ttl] roads: TtlBotRoadsA karma ledger judged and spent". Without the World Chronicle (WP-W1) the pay lines say
# "(no chronicle)"; the balance cap still counts.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotRoadsA
ttlbot spawn TtlBotRoadsB
ttlbot spawn TtlBotRoadsL
@sleep 3
ttl reset TtlBotRoadsA
ttl reset TtlBotRoadsB
ttl reset TtlBotRoadsL
@sleep 3
ttl roads test TtlBotRoadsA reset
ttl roads test TtlBotRoadsB reset
ttl roads test TtlBotRoadsL reset
ttl stash TtlBotRoadsL clear
ttl roads list
# Life 1 never pays (the paths open in Life 2).
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA try_necro.raise.dark life2only
# A to Life 2 on the platform; B waits in the Spirit Corridor (shared ground, another dimension: no witness).
ttl roads test TtlBotRoadsA life2
ttl roads test TtlBotRoadsB life2
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload add 3995 3995 4015 4005
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 3995 150 3995 4015 150 4005 minecraft:stone
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 3995 151 3995 4015 154 4005 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotRoadsA 4000 151 4000
execute in ttl:spirit_corridor run tp TtlBotRoadsB 0.5 65 0.5
@sleep 1
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA try_necro.raise.dark ok
ttl rep set TtlBotRoadsA holy_church 0
ttl rep set TtlBotRoadsA dwargon 0
ttl rep set TtlBotRoadsA orc_horde 0
# 1. A dark shortcut nobody sees: karma, balance, the Church, the first-time chronicle line; no renown.
ttl roads pay TtlBotRoadsA necro raise dark
ttl karma TtlBotRoadsA expect chaos2 3
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA chaos2 3
ttl rep expect TtlBotRoadsA holy_church value -3
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA last_witnesses 0
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA last_renown 0
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA last_first yes
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA first_necro.raise.dark yes
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA tide_dark 1
# 2. The same with a witness 10 blocks away: renown -1, and no second chronicle line.
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotRoadsB 4010 151 4000
@sleep 1
ttl roads witnesses TtlBotRoadsA
ttl roads pay TtlBotRoadsA necro raise dark
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA last_witnesses 1
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA last_renown -1
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA last_first no
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA chaos2 6
ttl rep expect TtlBotRoadsA holy_church value -6
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA count_necro.raise.dark 2
# 3. The grey road costs nothing; the good road pays (renown always, the Church, a light deed, order in the ledger).
ttl roads pay TtlBotRoadsA necro raise grey
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA chaos2 6
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA last_renown 0
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA tide_dark 2
ttl roads pay TtlBotRoadsA necro rest good
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA order2 1
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA last_renown 1
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA tide_light 1
ttl rep expect TtlBotRoadsA holy_church value -5
# 4. The wronged faction: stolen schematics cost Dwargon 20.
ttl roads pay TtlBotRoadsA artifice schematic dark
ttl rep expect TtlBotRoadsA dwargon value -20
# 5. The balance cap: 5 dark notes a soul a day (O-C2); karma and reputation are still paid.
ttl roads pay TtlBotRoadsA necro knight dark
ttl roads pay TtlBotRoadsA necro knight dark
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA tide_dark 5
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA last_noted 1
ttl roads pay TtlBotRoadsA necro knight dark
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA tide_dark 5
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA last_noted 0
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA last_rep_orc_horde 6
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA chaos2 18
ttl roads info TtlBotRoadsA
# 6. The ledger is the NEXT life's karma: kept by a reset, judged at x0.5 at the Life 1 death, then spent.
ttl roads expect TtlBotRoadsA carry_chaos 9
ttl reset TtlBotRoadsA
@sleep 3
ttl karma TtlBotRoadsA expect chaos2 18
kill TtlBotRoadsA
@sleep 2
ttl karma TtlBotRoadsA expect phase corridor
ttl karma TtlBotRoadsA expect carried_chaos 9
ttl karma TtlBotRoadsA expect chaos2 0
# 7. O-N1, Life 1 stays mortal: Occultism's ritual items (chalk) and the path items (tag ttl:paths) go to the soul stash within 2 s,
#    and Iron's blood and eldritch casts are refused in the Mortal dimensions only.
give TtlBotRoadsL occultism:chalk_white
give TtlBotRoadsL ttl:soul_ash 2
@sleep 3
ttl stash TtlBotRoadsL expect banned 0
ttl stash TtlBotRoadsL expect stash 2
ttl stash TtlBotRoadsL spell irons_spellbooks:blood yes
ttl stash TtlBotRoadsL spell irons_spellbooks:eldritch yes
ttl stash TtlBotRoadsL spell irons_spellbooks:fire no
ttl stash TtlBotRoadsB spell irons_spellbooks:blood no
# Clean up.
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload remove 3995 3995 4015 4005
ttl stash TtlBotRoadsL clear
ttl roads test TtlBotRoadsA reset
ttl roads test TtlBotRoadsB reset
ttl roads test TtlBotRoadsL reset
ttl reset TtlBotRoadsA
ttl reset TtlBotRoadsB
ttl reset TtlBotRoadsL
ttlbot remove TtlBotRoadsA
ttlbot remove TtlBotRoadsB
ttlbot remove TtlBotRoadsL
